-control.mdx","Control de acceso","Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/platform/administration/access-control",{"_75":344},"platform/administration/access-control.mdx",{"_49":346,"_56":68,"_51":347,"_62":348,"_71":-7,"_12":349,"_73":350},"es:platform/administration/audit-logs.mdx","Registros de auditoría","Entiende qué eventos de auditoría genera Lamassu y cómo convertirlos en una pista durable.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/platform/administration/audit-logs",{"_75":351},"platform/administration/audit-logs.mdx",{"_49":353,"_56":68,"_51":354,"_62":355,"_71":-7,"_12":356,"_73":357},"es:platform/administration/alerts.mdx","Alertas y suscripciones","Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/platform/administration/alerts",{"_75":358},"platform/administration/alerts.mdx","es:platform/administration",{"_204":361},"platform/administration/meta.json","es:platform",{"_204":364},"platform/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/images/lamassu.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/images/lamassu.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_56":57,"_51":16,"_59":60,"_61":-7,"_62":367,"_64":-7,"_53":368,"_49":432,"_73":433,"_71":435},"Ejecuta Lamassu en tu entorno",[369,376,378,385,392,399,405,408,415,418,425],{"_49":370,"_56":68,"_51":371,"_62":372,"_71":-7,"_12":373,"_73":374},"es:deployment/overview.mdx","Despliega Lamassu","Elige el modelo operativo que encaja con tu infraestructura y requisitos de control.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-52/es/deployment/overview",{"_75":375},"deployment/overview.mdx",{"_49":377,"_56":96,"_71":-7,"_51":17},"es:_7",{"_49":379,"_56":68,"_51":380,"_62":381,"_71":-7,"_12":382,"_73":383},"es:deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx","Kubernetes self-managed","Elige un flujo de ins